  "core_text": "不喝就是看不起我，领导，我不是看不起您，我是看不起病，这鸭子是好鸭子，就是嘴硬，嘴硬，才守得住秘密。哈哈哈，来这么晚，只能吃剩菜了吧。领导，饭在哪儿我都能吃，但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，能赶上已经是我的运气了。年轻就是好啊，年轻就是还不够沉稳，还要向您多学习，我们才能变得更优秀。这藕是好藕啊，就是心眼儿太多了。领导藕虽然心眼多，但也是您的下酒菜啊。小图最近表现不错啊，我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，我得提前敬一杯。听这意思，领导是要高升了呀，我得提前敬领导。一杯鱼是好鱼，可惜就是刺多。领导，您看，鱼虽然刺多，但主心骨只有一根心腹，是没有刺的。呵呵哈小图，你这菜点的也太多了。领导菜点的再多，也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒先敬，您真的打这么多饭，你喂猪呢？领导，我哪儿敢啊？我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，都说宰相肚里能撑船，更何况只是一碗饭呢。哎，你什么意思啊，怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了？领导美满，美满，代表幸福美满，这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊，今天让你破费了。领导，您说这些您能来，就是我的荣幸，以后还有很多地方向您请教，不是来就来，带什么礼物啊，都不是外人。领导，您都说了，不是外人，我一直都把您当长辈看，哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊。怎么你这一入职，我刚种的花就死了，花开富贵嘛，花开过了就剩富贵了。看来领导您啊要发大财了。哈哈，我真不怎么喜欢你，但您从来没有在工作上为难过，我领导的格局值得我们学习。小图啊，我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。小图啊，你个子是真高比，我还高一头呢。个高是为了给领导探路走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？哈哈哈啊哈小图啊，你一开口就让人喜欢你，你是怎么做到的？因为我一直在看这本闲谈高手，这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，那些会说话、会来事儿的人。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交。推荐你读完这本闲谈高手，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。在这本书里有一句话，我特别欣赏，他，写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，你可以回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当有人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下吴若冰，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？当我看到这段的时候，这个真是让我一解心开啊。每一句都很有意思，就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下应该怎么说。书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心的拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，但凡学会三分，你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。这本书真的可以帮助到大家。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 1930,
      "text": "不喝就是看不起我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2810,
      "end_ms": 3250,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3650,
      "end_ms": 4790,
      "text": "我不是看不起您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5370,
      "end_ms": 6415,
      "text": "我是看不起病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9090,
      "end_ms": 10590,
      "text": "这鸭子是好鸭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10970,
      "end_ms": 11770,
      "text": "就是嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00007",
      "start_ms": 12610,
      "end_ms": 13090,
      "text": "嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13150,
      "end_ms": 14205,
      "text": "才守得住秘密。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00009",
      "start_ms": 16120,
      "end_ms": 16615,
      "text": "哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00010",
      "start_ms": 19060,
      "end_ms": 19700,
      "text": "来这么晚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00011",
      "start_ms": 19900,
      "end_ms": 20980,
      "text": "只能吃剩菜了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00012",
      "start_ms": 21380,
      "end_ms": 21780,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00013",
      "start_ms": 22060,
      "end_ms": 23280,
      "text": "饭在哪儿我都能吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00014",
      "start_ms": 23500,
      "end_ms": 25480,
      "text": "但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00015",
      "start_ms": 25540,
      "end_ms": 26895,
      "text": "能赶上已经是我的运气了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00016",
      "start_ms": 29080,
      "end_ms": 30400,
      "text": "年轻就是好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00017",
      "start_ms": 30800,
      "end_ms": 32480,
      "text": "年轻就是还不够沉稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00018",
      "start_ms": 32700,
      "end_ms": 33900,
      "text": "还要向您多学习，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00019",
      "start_ms": 34080,
      "end_ms": 35675,
      "text": "我们才能变得更优秀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00020",
      "start_ms": 38060,
      "end_ms": 39240,
      "text": "这藕是好藕啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00021",
      "start_ms": 39700,
      "end_ms": 41340,
      "text": "就是心眼儿太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00022",
      "start_ms": 41340,
      "end_ms": 43300,
      "text": "领导藕虽然心眼多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00023",
      "start_ms": 43300,
      "end_ms": 48100,
      "text": "但也是您的下酒菜啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00024",
      "start_ms": 48100,
      "end_ms": 49720,
      "text": "小图最近表现不错啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00025",
      "start_ms": 49720,
      "end_ms": 51520,
      "text": "我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00026",
      "start_ms": 51520,
      "end_ms": 52620,
      "text": "我得提前敬一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00027",
      "start_ms": 53100,
      "end_ms": 53820,
      "text": "听这意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00028",
      "start_ms": 53860,
      "end_ms": 55040,
      "text": "领导是要高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00029",
      "start_ms": 55040,
      "end_ms": 56160,
      "text": "我得提前敬领导。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00030",
      "start_ms": 56160,
      "end_ms": 58920,
      "text": "一杯鱼是好鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00031",
      "start_ms": 59220,
      "end_ms": 60295,
      "text": "可惜就是刺多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00032",
      "start_ms": 60700,
      "end_ms": 60960,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00033",
      "start_ms": 60960,
      "end_ms": 61320,
      "text": "您看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00034",
      "start_ms": 61580,
      "end_ms": 62680,
      "text": "鱼虽然刺多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00035",
      "start_ms": 62760,
      "end_ms": 64560,
      "text": "但主心骨只有一根心腹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00036",
      "start_ms": 64560,
      "end_ms": 65395,
      "text": "是没有刺的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00037",
      "start_ms": 66310,
      "end_ms": 68500,
      "text": "呵呵哈小图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00038",
      "start_ms": 68620,
      "end_ms": 70115,
      "text": "你这菜点的也太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00039",
      "start_ms": 70500,
      "end_ms": 72050,
      "text": "领导菜点的再多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00040",
      "start_ms": 72150,
      "end_ms": 75070,
      "text": "也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒先敬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00041",
      "start_ms": 75070,
      "end_ms": 78940,
      "text": "您真的打这么多饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00042",
      "start_ms": 79000,
      "end_ms": 79720,
      "text": "你喂猪呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00043",
      "start_ms": 79820,
      "end_ms": 80260,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00044",
      "start_ms": 80320,
      "end_ms": 81080,
      "text": "我哪儿敢啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00045",
      "start_ms": 81220,
      "end_ms": 83280,
      "text": "我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00046",
      "start_ms": 83280,
      "end_ms": 84760,
      "text": "都说宰相肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00047",
      "start_ms": 84880,
      "end_ms": 86345,
      "text": "更何况只是一碗饭呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00048",
      "start_ms": 88230,
      "end_ms": 88575,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00049",
      "start_ms": 88970,
      "end_ms": 89790,
      "text": "你什么意思啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00050",
      "start_ms": 89890,
      "end_ms": 91215,
      "text": "怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00051",
      "start_ms": 91480,
      "end_ms": 92360,
      "text": "领导美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00052",
      "start_ms": 92360,
      "end_ms": 92765,
      "text": "美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00053",
      "start_ms": 93070,
      "end_ms": 94170,
      "text": "代表幸福美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00054",
      "start_ms": 94290,
      "end_ms": 96285,
      "text": "这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00055",
      "start_ms": 98390,
      "end_ms": 99405,
      "text": "今天让你破费了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00056",
      "start_ms": 99640,
      "end_ms": 100020,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00057",
      "start_ms": 100120,
      "end_ms": 101860,
      "text": "您说这些您能来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00058",
      "start_ms": 101860,
      "end_ms": 102715,
      "text": "就是我的荣幸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00059",
      "start_ms": 103120,
      "end_ms": 104880,
      "text": "以后还有很多地方向您请教，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00060",
      "start_ms": 104880,
      "end_ms": 108380,
      "text": "不是来就来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00061",
      "start_ms": 108400,
      "end_ms": 109400,
      "text": "带什么礼物啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00062",
      "start_ms": 109420,
      "end_ms": 110220,
      "text": "都不是外人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00063",
      "start_ms": 110380,
      "end_ms": 110760,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00064",
      "start_ms": 110960,
      "end_ms": 111560,
      "text": "您都说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00065",
      "start_ms": 111560,
      "end_ms": 112200,
      "text": "不是外人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00066",
      "start_ms": 112200,
      "end_ms": 113500,
      "text": "我一直都把您当长辈看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00067",
      "start_ms": 113740,
      "end_ms": 115965,
      "text": "哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00068",
      "start_ms": 117910,
      "end_ms": 119005,
      "text": "怎么你这一入职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00069",
      "start_ms": 119510,
      "end_ms": 120730,
      "text": "我刚种的花就死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00070",
      "start_ms": 120990,
      "end_ms": 121950,
      "text": "花开富贵嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00071",
      "start_ms": 121950,
      "end_ms": 123330,
      "text": "花开过了就剩富贵了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00072",
      "start_ms": 123410,
      "end_ms": 125315,
      "text": "看来领导您啊要发大财了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00073",
      "start_ms": 125980,
      "end_ms": 126440,
      "text": "哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00074",
      "start_ms": 126830,
      "end_ms": 128065,
      "text": "我真不怎么喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00075",
      "start_ms": 128410,
      "end_ms": 130290,
      "text": "但您从来没有在工作上为难过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00076",
      "start_ms": 130290,
      "end_ms": 132585,
      "text": "我领导的格局值得我们学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00077",
      "start_ms": 136840,
      "end_ms": 137460,
      "text": "小图啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00078",
      "start_ms": 137740,
      "end_ms": 139495,
      "text": "我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00079",
      "start_ms": 140260,
      "end_ms": 142560,
      "text": "思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00080",
      "start_ms": 142780,
      "end_ms": 144795,
      "text": "只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00081",
      "start_ms": 146910,
      "end_ms": 147545,
      "text": "小图啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00082",
      "start_ms": 147860,
      "end_ms": 149120,
      "text": "你个子是真高比，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00083",
      "start_ms": 149120,
      "end_ms": 149995,
      "text": "我还高一头呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00084",
      "start_ms": 150450,
      "end_ms": 154275,
      "text": "个高是为了给领导探路走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00085",
      "start_ms": 154660,
      "end_ms": 156510,
      "text": "哈哈哈啊哈小图啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00086",
      "start_ms": 156750,
      "end_ms": 158365,
      "text": "你一开口就让人喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00087",
      "start_ms": 158610,
      "end_ms": 159565,
      "text": "你是怎么做到的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00088",
      "start_ms": 159870,
      "end_ms": 162010,
      "text": "因为我一直在看这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00089",
      "start_ms": 162210,
      "end_ms": 163970,
      "text": "这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00090",
      "start_ms": 164030,
      "end_ms": 165910,
      "text": "那些会说话、会来事儿的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00091",
      "start_ms": 166050,
      "end_ms": 167130,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00092",
      "start_ms": 167270,
      "end_ms": 167970,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00093",
      "start_ms": 168110,
      "end_ms": 168930,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00094",
      "start_ms": 169050,
      "end_ms": 170170,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00095",
      "start_ms": 170510,
      "end_ms": 172505,
      "text": "推荐你读完这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00096",
      "start_ms": 172850,
      "end_ms": 175045,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00097",
      "start_ms": 175350,
      "end_ms": 176570,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00098",
      "start_ms": 176710,
      "end_ms": 178085,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00099",
      "start_ms": 178390,
      "end_ms": 180990,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00100",
      "start_ms": 181110,
      "end_ms": 182450,
      "text": "在这本书里有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00101",
      "start_ms": 182510,
      "end_ms": 183375,
      "text": "我特别欣赏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00102",
      "start_ms": 183720,
      "end_ms": 183880,
      "text": "他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00103",
      "start_ms": 183880,
      "end_ms": 185920,
      "text": "写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00104",
      "start_ms": 186080,
      "end_ms": 186885,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00105",
      "start_ms": 187320,
      "end_ms": 188280,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00106",
      "start_ms": 188340,
      "end_ms": 189615,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00107",
      "start_ms": 190020,
      "end_ms": 191660,
      "text": "当有人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00108",
      "start_ms": 191740,
      "end_ms": 193505,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00109",
      "start_ms": 193770,
      "end_ms": 194690,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00110",
      "start_ms": 194790,
      "end_ms": 197850,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00111",
      "start_ms": 197950,
      "end_ms": 199175,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00112",
      "start_ms": 199430,
      "end_ms": 200595,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00113",
      "start_ms": 200910,
      "end_ms": 202305,
      "text": "强将手下吴若冰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00114",
      "start_ms": 202590,
      "end_ms": 203965,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00115",
      "start_ms": 204240,
      "end_ms": 205580,
      "text": "当我看到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00116",
      "start_ms": 205620,
      "end_ms": 207485,
      "text": "这个真是让我一解心开啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00117",
      "start_ms": 207800,
      "end_ms": 209080,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00118",
      "start_ms": 209280,
      "end_ms": 212500,
      "text": "就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下应该怎么说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00119",
      "start_ms": 212760,
      "end_ms": 215435,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00120",
      "start_ms": 215680,
      "end_ms": 217125,
      "text": "你就放心的拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00121",
      "start_ms": 217450,
      "end_ms": 218790,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00122",
      "start_ms": 219010,
      "end_ms": 221475,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00123",
      "start_ms": 221810,
      "end_ms": 222890,
      "text": "但凡学会三分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00124",
      "start_ms": 223090,
      "end_ms": 225515,
      "text": "你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fdc54f807b359bf0_s00125",
      "start_ms": 225910,
      "end_ms": 227565,
      "text": "这本书真的可以帮助到大家。"
    }
  ],
